<title>NETHERLANDS: Ahold acquires Dutch food wholesaler.</title>
<headline>Ahold acquires Dutch food wholesaler.</headline>
<dateline>ZAANDAM, Netherlands 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supermarkets group Ahold NV said on Tuesday its GVA institutional food supply unit had agreed to buy Dutch food wholesaler Van der Spek from Dutch dairy products group Campina Melkunie.</p>
<p>Ahold said Van der Spek was a leading wholesale food supplier to restaurants in the Netherlands with annual sales in 1996 of 180 million guilders.</p>
</text>
